Oleksii Zakharov's common UML speed commits from
https://github.com/zalexdev/linux-um-arm64 (branch um-arm64), squashed
against Linux 7.2.9: 81fc0f12b6 (stub handoff wake elision and spin),
72cc9b79bb (cycle counter probe), d2219a3ded and 0489ef6e4a (anonymous
fault-around), 1d555ded4d, 7d1b5396f1 and ce1a317551 (ncpus default),
d06cc2a4ec (stub reaper).

Changed here: x86_64 spins too. The stub reads rdtsc, and
check_stub_cycles() measures the TSC rate when CPUID 0x80000007 says
the TSC is invariant; upstream x86 returns a zero rate and never spins.
Boot switches: seccomp_spin=US (0 = off), prefault=BYTES (0 = off).
Measurements: nixidae/nixidae#1412.

